# Host build artefacts must never enter the image. pnpm's isolated node_modules
# is a tree of symlinks into a store at the workspace root; copying the host's
# copy in puts absolute host paths inside the container and pnpm then refuses to
# run with a dependency-status error.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.astro
**/.astro
.vercel

.git
.github
graphify-out
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.sql
cookies.txt
